    {
      "source": "Doctors of Running",
      "priority": 3,
      "url": "https://www.doctorsofrunning.com/2025/05/asics-gel-kayano-32-review-2025-8mm-drop.html",
      "type": "qualitative",
      "keyFindings": [
        "Cushioning: The ride is well-cushioned but slightly firmer than expected, with improved heel compression/transition for impact protection and a stiff, less-flexible forefoot feel.",
        "Responsiveness: There is some bounce from the 4D Guidance system and a mildly snappy forefoot, but overall energy return feels moderate and better suited to easy paces than fast running.",
        "Stability: Moderate-to-strong guidance comes from a wide base, medial/lateral sidewalls, adaptive geometry that resists excess motion, and a stiff heel counter (softly padded) with generally good lateral support.",
        "Durability: Expected durability is average; traction is solid on dry roads but mild wet slippage was noted, and slight outsole/midsole wear appeared at exposed FF Blast+ after about 30 miles."
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "Believe in the Run",
      "priority": 5,
      "url": "https://believeintherun.com/shoe-reviews/asics-gel-kayano-32-review/",
      "type": "qualitative",
      "keyFindings": [
        "Cushioning: FF Blast Plus Eco is soft but not mushy, with an overall firmer-than-max-cushion feel; Rearfoot PureGEL provides clear heel-strike impact protection and a more heel-cushioned ride than forefoot plushness.",
        "Responsiveness: The ride is described as consistent rather than lively, with no rocker sensation and limited bounce/snappiness, making it better for easy/recovery running than speed work.",
        "Stability: Stability is a standout via the 4D Guidance System and wide base, giving strong anti-overpronation control and dependable lateral support; the heel feels slightly heavier.",
        "Durability: The AsicsGrip outsole is specifically called good quality and durable, with substantial rubber/grooving that suggests strong wear resistance and long material longevity."
      ]
    }
